{"slug":"peoplesafe-alert","title":"Emergency Alert System","desc":"An emergency alert system that is secure, cost-effective, encrypted and provides fast communication during critical incidents and emergencies.","og":"https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/ps-alert-hero.png","content":"<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/hero {\"label\":\"Emergency Alert System\",\"title\":\"Peoplesafe Alert\",\"intro\":\"Simple and dedicated emergency alert system.\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e£0 set up costs\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eSet up in 1 hour and send messages in seconds\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eActive Directory and HR platform integrations\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"demo-dialog\",\"variant\":\"\"},{\"linkText\":\"Get a Quote\",\"link\":\"/uk/get-your-quote/\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/ps-alert-hero.png@@\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/trustpilot-widget {\"widget\":\"horizontal\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"See how it works\",\"mediaType\":\"video\",\"videoUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/nKSsrSQ4U2I\",\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Watch our video to see how our emergency alert system protects employees.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Dedicated channel for operational communications\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/peoplesafe-alert-tab1.png@@\",\"framed\":false} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The number one problem in any emergency is communication. Using an emergency alert system increases operational resilience to daily risks, helping to streamline crisis management communications and disaster recovery to accelerate response times.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"/uk/products/peoplesafe-alert/\">Peoplesafe Alert</a> is a simple mass notification software platform enabling two-way communications across app, SMS, email and desktop alerts for businesses to use to effectively communicate with their workforce.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It provides an effective and reliable alternative to WhatsApp, Microsoft Teams and social media, ensuring you send the right message to the right people wherever they are.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What makes Peoplesafe Alert different?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/top-tabs {\"tabs\":[{\"title\":\"Air-gapped\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/welfare-check-icon.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Air-gapped\",\"heading\":\"Never miss a message\",\"content\":\"Fail-safe communication guarantees delivery from a separate server, protecting against network outages and cyber-attacks.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/peoplesafe-alert-tab2.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Override silent settings\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/audio.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Override silent settings\",\"heading\":\"Ensure vital messages are read\",\"content\":\"Reach staff with crisis communications even if their device is muted. Send notifications repeatedly until it has been read or responded to.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/peoplesafe-alert-tab1.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Rapid and trusted\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/timed-alarms.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Accelerate response times\",\"heading\":\"Rapid and trusted\",\"content\":\"Send up to 2,000 messages per second. The service is hosted in the UK, fully GDPR compliant and ISO27001 certified.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/peoplesafe-alert-tab3.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Reporting\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/reporting-icon.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Reporting\",\"heading\":\"Real-time insights\",\"content\":\"Instantly track message delivery and recipient responses from one easy to understand dashboard.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/peoplesafe-alert-tab3.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Multichannel comms\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/icon-apps.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Multichannel comms\",\"heading\":\"Streamline notifications\",\"content\":\"Dedicated channel for communications. Send emergency notifications or safety reminders to your workforce across app, SMS, email and desktop alerts.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/peoplesafe-alert-tab2.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Set up in an hour, send messages in seconds\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/peoplesafe-alert-tab2.png@@\",\"framed\":false} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Peoplesafe Alert platform is so simple and straightforward to use that the training required to be proficient is minimal.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We will work with you to implement best practice and brainstorm scenarios to set up groups of people that you might need to contact, for example first aiders, IT engineers or lone workers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Using these groups and likely scenarios, you can create message templates to standardise your response to certain events and save valuable time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/side-tabs {\"title\":\"How Peoplesafe Alert is used\",\"tabs\":[{\"title\":\"Crisis Management\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eWarn and inform staff of a critical event.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"list\":\"\",\"linkText\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/iStock-1135346386-modified-e95786d4-3e08-4ca0-8b19-e7eccc4c72d3-1024x576.jpg@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Business Continuity\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eQuickly enact your emergency response plan to reduce the impact of the incident.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"list\":\"\",\"linkText\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/iStock-808157966-modified-6e975123-b058-4d2b-a621-811994c68df1-1024x576.jpg@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Lone Workers\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eProactively communicate instructions and information to your dispersed workforce.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"list\":\"\",\"linkText\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/iStock-850712896-modified-b44ca6d6-0336-4682-92bb-72cd4f2ca0b5-1024x576.jpg@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Mobilise Operational Team\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eGather key team members to respond to a critical event.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"list\":\"\",\"linkText\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/iStock-1363105072-modified-fef6ce85-a9bb-45bb-94b5-e0000cb8422e-1024x576.jpg@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Security Threats\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eRespond quickly to an active safety incident (e.g. terror attack).\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"list\":\"\",\"linkText\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/iStock-1252726698-modified-583c0983-fd04-47c5-895b-a460f6629f40-1024x576.jpg@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Office Safety\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eLockdown and evacuate sites during emergencies or communicate facilities issues.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"list\":\"\",\"linkText\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/slid_Evacuation3-1024x430.jpg@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"IT Escalations\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eNotify your IT team of a suspected network outage or cyber-attack.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"list\":\"\",\"linkText\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/iStock-2035601113-1024x391.jpg@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Severe Weather\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eShare critical information with affected employees during severe weather events.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"list\":\"\",\"linkText\":\"\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/flooded-road-with-sign.jpg@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Download eBook\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Download eBook\",\"link\":\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/peoplesafe-alert-e-book-download/?teaser=yes\",\"linkTarget\":true,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/ps-alert-eBook-turtl.jpg@@\",\"framed\":false,\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Want to learn more about how Peoplesafe Alert can warn and inform your workforce about critical events?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Download our comprehensive product eBook for detailed information on its exclusive features and benefits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Discover why Peoplesafe Alert is such a reliable form of communication in crisis situations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/peoplesafe-alert-e-book-download/?teaser=yes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download eBook</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/faq {\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"faqs\":[{\"question\":\"How much does Peoplesafe Alert cost?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eThe cost for Peoplesafe Alert depends on the number of administrator licenses you need and how many people you’re looking to communicate with. The solution is scalable to be able to support SMEs and multinational organisations.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"Are there any setup fees for Peoplesafe Alert?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eNo, we don’t charge implementation or setup fees and there are no hidden costs such as professional services or system configuration.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"How long does it take to implement Peoplesafe Alert?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eOnce all your data is loaded into the Peoplesafe Alert portal you could be sending out communications in just one hour. Working with our software specialist, they will train all administrators on how to use the system. Because the platform is so simple and straightforward to use, this usually only takes around 30 minutes.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"Why do I need an emergency notification system?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eBusinesses require a continuity plan to comply with the Health \\u0026amp; Safety Executive (HSE) guidelines. Communication and speed of response is vital in an emergency. While emails and messaging platforms (e.g. WhatsApp) are useful in a number of business situations, they are not designed for use in an emergency.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eUnlike a dedicated emergency notification system, it’s not possible to report on how many people have opened and responded to messages sent via email, SMS and social media in real time. Similarly, messages on these platforms can be forwarded and edited. As a result, staff could be working from outdated or incorrect information which will hinder response times.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"How can a mass notification service be used during a cyber attack?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eIn the event of a cyber attack, standard methods of business communication (i.e. email) would be prevented. Mass notification tools are typically ‘air-gapped’ and are therefore independent from other systems and software meaning it will not be compromised during a cyber attack.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"Does the emergency alert system work internationally?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes, using the web-based portal messages can be sent from anywhere in the world to anywhere in the world. The Peoplesafe Alert app is available to download in all countries.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"Is Peoplesafe Alert secure?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes, our data hosting is certified to hold and transact UK Government communications to the OFFICAL level of security classification.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/cta-banner {\"theme\":\"orange\",\"title\":\"See how it works\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eTo get a Peoplesafe Alert demo, contact our experts using the form below.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/form {\"formUrl\":\"https://safe.peoplesafe.co.uk/l/830213/2024-03-19/2hpfv4\",\"height\":550} /-->","menu_order":9,"types":["emergency-notifications","safety-apps"]}